  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Identifie les fantômes dans la Tour Pokémon.",
      "short_effect": "Utilisé pour identifier les vraies formes des fantômes de la Tour Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Identifies ghosts in Pokémon Tower.",
      "short_effect": "Used to identify the true forms of ghosts in Pokémon Tower.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "SILPH CO’s scope\nmakes unseeable\nPOKéMON visible.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "emerald",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/6/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A scope that makes unseeable\nPOKéMON visible.\nIt is made by SILPH CO.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "firered-leafgreen",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/7/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ひとの　めに　みえない　ものを\nみることが　できる　スコープ。\nシルフカンパニーせい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "사람의 눈에 보이지 않는 것을\n볼 수 있게 해 주는 스코프.\n실프주식회사 제품.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "西爾佛公司製造的檢視鏡。\n能看見人類肉眼\n看不到的東西。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un appareil permettant de voir les Pokémon invisibles.\nIl est fabriqué par la Sylphe SARL.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Gerät macht Dinge sichtbar, die dem\nmenschlichen Auge sonst verborgen bleiben.\nEs wurde von der Silph Company entwickelt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dispositivo que permite ver cosas que, de otra forma,\nresultarían invisibles para el ojo humano. Fabricado por\nSilph S. A.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sonda che rivela i Pokémon invisibili, prodotta\ndalla Silph S.p.A.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A scope that lets you see what cannot usually be seen.\nIt is made by Silph Co.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "人の　目に　見えない　ものを\n見ることが　できる　スコープ。\nシルフカンパニー製。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "西尔佛公司制造的透视镜。\n可以看见人眼无法看见的东西。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
